# Frontend-focused global control

**CRM Plus / Marketing Plus (MPCP)** — JSP + vanilla JS + CSS. Treat tasks as **frontend-first** by default.

## Where rules live

| Location | Role |
|----------|------|
| `.cursor/rules/project-overview.mdc` | Auto-applied repo context |
| `.cursor/rules/frontend-context.mdc` | Auto-applied when `WebContent/` files are open |
| `.cursor/frontend/rules/` | **Detailed** standards and component guide |
| `.cursor/frontend/commands/` | CSS audit and reflow detection workflows |

## Frontend tasks

UI, CSS, HTML, JS, JSP, Handlebars, styles, components, Figma-to-code, or anything under `WebContent/`.

1. Load relevant files from `.cursor/frontend/rules/`
2. Reuse existing classes from `WebContent/styles/core/`
3. Mention which rule files you used

## Design generation (Figma / prompts)

Follow `crm-plus-components-rules.md` and output its Component Usage Review Report (§7).

## API tasks with UI impact

REST config: `WebContent/WEB-INF/conf/Crmplus/resources.yml`. Handlers: `src/com/adventnet/zoho/rest/resource/handlers/`. Focus on what the frontend needs.

## Stack

No npm/Vue/React. `$()` = getElementById; `$j` = jQuery. VCS: Mercurial.
